{"ts":"2026-08-24T10:27:09.257Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"365e646596cb83e6152b34c6","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"Reachable whenever a package releases twice in one calendar day, which the workflow supports by design through its max-suffix logic."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pmc-lnyt"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"The version-derived release date refuses the same-day suffix the release workflow actually emits"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The release workflow tags a second release on one day as v2026.8.24-2 and stamps that version into package.json. calendarDateFromVersion required a strict YYYY.M.D and threw on anything else, so the date-from-version flag failed hard on exactly the day a package released twice. That turns a stale heading date, which is what the flag exists to remove, into a broken release. Found by CodeRabbit on the fleet rollout of that flag, on pm-beads pull request 79, before any package could hit it. Verified directly against the published 2026.8.17 binary, where a suffixed release version exits 1 with the parser message rather than producing a heading. The suffix distinguishes releases, not days, so it is parsed and discarded and the date is the calendar day while the suffix survives in the version heading itself. Non-numeric suffixes such as a beta spelling are still refused, because those are prerelease identifiers rather than same-day counters and inventing a date for them would be a guess, and an impossible calendar date is still refused even when it carries a suffix."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["changelog","regression","release"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-24T10:27:09.257Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-24T10:27:09.257Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/assignee","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":40},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A suffixed calendar version derives the calendar day and keeps its suffix in the heading, a non-numeric suffix is still refused, and an impossible date is still refused with or without a suffix"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pmc-q22j","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-24T10:27:09.257Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-24T10:27:09.257Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Caught on the fleet rollout before it could break a release, rather than after."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-24T10:27:09.257Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Reverting only the parser while keeping the test fails one test; restoring passes 390."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-24T10:27:09.257Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"A validator written against the version format a package normally has will refuse the format its own release workflow emits in the less common case; check the workflow, not the current version."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/files","value":[{"path":"src/release-context.ts","scope":"project"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tests","value":[{"command":"npm test","scope":"project"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/docs","value":[{"path":"https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/blob/main/README.md","scope":"project","note":"flag reference"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"c59eb166ee81ed8a21b5917d25d17ea661a1c34de4bb41b048e114b8c97d883d","item_hash_version":2,"message":"Accept the same-day release suffix in the version-derived date","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
